Public Hearing regarding a Zone Change from A-2 to MU for Tract 5,
Mesa Tracts, Laramie County, WY.
24 - 177
PZ-24-00023 LCPC STAFF REPORT PKG 4.11.24
Attachments:
Jason Arnold, Planning Manager, said that Inberg-Miller Engineers, on behalf of
Trystin and Mike Green, has submitted a Zone Change Application for this property
located in the Mesa Tracts Subdivision located at 8619 US HWY 30, near the
intersection with Dell Range Road. The application asks to rezone the property from
A-2 - Agricultural to MU - Mixed Use, which would allow commercial trailer sales to
take place at the property while still also being used as a residence. A site plan will be
processed administratively by the Planning Department following approval of the Zone
Change.
